  "description": "One record, pinned field by field rather than as an image - and the field that matters most here is CUST-DOB-YYYY-MM-DD. app/cpy/CVCUS01Y.cpy spells it with dashes; app/cpy/CUSTREC.cpy spells the same 10-byte span at the same offset CUST-DOB-YYYYMMDD, and the statement package models that copybook separately as Stm03CustomerRecord. Naming the field here means a translation that collapsed the two layouts onto one type, or renamed this span to the CUSTREC spelling, is reported as a missing field rather than passing silently. All 19 spans are named because a partial expectation asserts nothing about the bytes it leaves out. Four lines: the banner, the record twice, the banner.",
